ak = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:rooster/chicken/fowl) (d:domestic fowl; in the verses the rooster that crows) (e:khit phetin ~ a khuang pah hi) (r:40.26.74) (q:draft)
ak = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:raven/crow) (d:as the second part of va-ak, raven or crow) (e:va-~ nam khempeuh) (r:3.11.15/19.147.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
alangte = (t:n) (w:half) (d:alang half with the plural ending -te, used of the half-tribe, minam alangte) (e:Moses in Manasseh minam ~ tungah) (b:alang) (r:6.13.29/6.22.1) (q:draft)
