galvil = (t:n) (w:watchman/lookout/sentry/guard) (d:one who keeps watch for the enemy, from gal enemy and vil watch; also the act of keeping watch) (e:sun leh zanin ~ ka koih uh hi) (r:16.4.9/23.21.6) (q:draft)
geel = (t:v) (w:plan/devise/design) (d:think out beforehand what is to be done or made) (e:Mihing in thu ~ a) (r:20.16.9/23.46.11) (q:draft)
hilhkhol = (t:v) (w:warn/forewarn/tell beforehand) (d:hilh tell with khol beforehand) (e:Mi gilo khat ~ napi-in) (r:26.3.19/1.43.3) (q:draft)
hilhkhol = (t:v) (w:prophesy/testify) (d:speak a message beforehand, in thu hilhkhol) (e:thu a ~ ding uh hi) (r:44.2.18/30.3.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
husan = (t:n) (w:breath) (d:breath of a living being; also a single breath as something that passes quickly) (e:A ~’ in mei tawhkuang a) (b:hu) (r:18.41.21/1.7.15) (q:draft)
innkhum = (t:n) (w:roof/housetop) (d:the top of a house; innkhum zang is the flat roof or an upper room) (e:~ tungah a omte in zong) (r:40.24.17/19.102.7) (q:draft)
inntual = (t:n) (w:courtyard/court) (d:the open space in front of or enclosed by a house) (e:~ lai zangah mei cih uh a) (r:42.22.55/41.14.66) (q:draft)
khamin = (t:v) (w:risk/stake/pledge) (d:kham with the linking ending -in: putting something at stake, as risking one's life or pledging fields for a loan) (e:nuntakna ~ a pai) (r:10.23.17/16.5.4) (q:draft)
khamin = (t:adj) (w:drunk) (d:kham drunk with the linking ending -in, being drunk, as in zu khamin) (e:zu ne-in zu ~ a om laitak) (b:kham) (r:11.20.16) (q:draft)
khamin = (t:v) (w:be troubled/be grieved) (d:in lung khamin, with a troubled heart) (e:Ka lung ~ ka lungsim hong nat ciangin) (r:19.73.21) (q:draft, low confidence)
khamul = (t:n) (w:beard) (d:hair growing on the chin) (e:ka sam leh ka ~ botin) (r:15.9.3/3.19.27) (q:draft)
