lunghihmawhna = (t:n) (w:anxiety/worry/concern/care) (e:~ in lungkhamna piangsak a) (b:lunghihmawh) (r:20.12.25/60.5.7) (q:draft)
maizumsak = (t:v) (w:shame/put to shame/humiliate) (d:maizum ashamed with the causative sak; in Luke 9.26 be ashamed of someone) (e:kei hong ~ kei in) (b:maizum) (r:19.25.20/20.25.10) (q:draft)
muat = (t:v) (w:rot/decay/perish) (d:muat thei is perishable, muat theih lohna and muat lohna are imperishability, immortality) (e:~ nading a piang ding hi) (r:51.2.22/46.15.53) (q:draft)
