naita = (t:v) (w:be near/draw near/be at hand) (d:nai near with ta, which marks a change of state: has come near, of a time or event) (e:Buk Pawi hun hong ~ ahih manin) (r:43.7.2/26.30.3) (q:draft)
ngaihsutin = (t:v) (w:think about/consider/pay attention to) (d:ngaihsut with the linking ending -in; ngaihsutin nei is set the mind on, take to heart) (e:Vantungah a om thute ~ nei unla) (b:ngaihsut) (r:51.3.2/2.7.23) (q:draft)
