sukha = (t:v) (w:touch/harm/affect) (d:come against someone or something, and so hurt or affect it) (e:Ka sathau nilhte ~ kei un) (r:19.105.15/18.35.6) (q:draft)
tee = (t:v) (w:shine/sparkle/flash/gleam) (d:give off bright light, as polished metal or a precious stone) (e:tua leengpeite suangmanpha bangin ~ hi) (r:26.10.9/27.2.31) (q:draft)
thatte = (t:n) (w:murderers/killers) (d:those who kill, that with the plural ending -te, usually as mi thatte) (e:tua mi ~ khempeuh thatin) (b:that) (r:40.22.7/40.5.21) (q:draft)
