khauhual = (t:n) (w:rope/cord) (e:~ tawh nang hong kikhih ding a) (r:26.3.25/21.4.12) (q:draft)
kheemna = (t:n) (w:deceit/deception/trickery/scheme) (e:na leii un ~ khang sak hi) (b:kheem) (r:19.50.19/49.6.11) (q:draft)
kheemna = (t:n) (w:temptation) (d:being enticed or tested to do wrong; kheemna thuak is to be tempted, as in the Lord's Prayer) (e:~ hong thuaksak kei in) (b:kheem) (r:40.6.13/40.26.41) (q:draft)
khialhsakna = (t:n) (w:causing to sin) (d:the act of making others do wrong, or the sin that someone led others into; khialhsak with na) (e:Israel a ~ ama khialhna mah zui hi) (r:11.15.26/11.14.16) (q:draft)
kihhuaina = (t:n) (w:abomination/detestable thing/impurity) (d:something disgusting or unclean, or the state of being so) (e:Pasian mai-ah ~ ahi hi) (b:kihhuai) (r:42.16.15/52.4.7) (q:draft)
laamto = (t:v) (w:lift up/raise) (d:to raise the hands or the heart, also to lift a person out of trouble) (e:na khutte uh ~ un la) (r:19.134.2/19.107.41) (q:draft)
