thutheihna = (t:n) (w:knowledge/understanding) (d:thu, matter, theih, know, with na: knowing and understanding of things) (e:thakhauhna sangin ~ hoihzaw hi) (r:20.24.5/18.28.12) (q:draft)
tute = (t:n) (w:grandchildren) (d:tu, grandchild, with the plural te) (e:Na ~ a mu dingin) (r:19.128.6/1.31.55) (q:draft)
tute = (t:n) (w:those sitting/those seated) (d:tu, sit, with the plural te: the ones who sit) (e:a ~ lakah a hawmsak hi) (r:43.6.11/7.5.10) (q:draft)
vanah = (t:adv) (w:in heaven/in the sky) (d:van, heaven or sky, with the place marker ah; vanah vasate are the birds of the air) (e:~ a om vangliatnate a kiliing ding) (b:van) (r:41.13.25/66.12.3) (q:draft)
veng = (t:v) (w:cease/stop/pass away/depart) (d:of a plague, trouble or season, to come to an end and be gone) (e:Phalbi ~ ta a, guahzu nawn lo hi) (r:22.2.11/4.16.48) (q:draft)
veng = (t:n) (w:neighbourhood/neighbour/quarter) (d:the part of a village or town where one lives, and the people who live near) (e:Amah in na ~ nai hi lo a) (r:5.22.2) (q:draft)
zuaupi = (t:n) (w:lie/falsehood/great lie) (d:zuau, lie, with pi, great: something wholly false or empty) (e:a kisialhna teng ~ hi-in) (b:zuau) (r:24.48.30/24.5.2) (q:draft)
