atpa = (t:n) (w:scribe/secretary/writer) (d:found in lai-atpa, from lai, writing, and at, write, with pa marking a man: one who writes, a scribe or secretary) (e:Sheva in lai-~ ahi hi) (r:10.20.25/13.24.6) (q:draft)
awte = (t:n) (w:voices/sounds) (e:lungdamna leh kipahna ~) (b:aw) (r:24.25.10/66.10.3) (q:draft)
bawlnate = (t:n) (w:deeds/works/doings) (e:a vanglian nangma ~ taangko ding a) (b:bawlna) (r:19.145.6/19.66.5) (q:draft)
cip = (t:adv) (w:tightly/firmly/fast/completely) (d:placed after a verb to show that the action is done tightly or so that it stays: sin cip seal up, seel cip hide away, ding cip stand still) (e:aksite sin ~ hi) (r:18.9.7/4.19.15) (q:draft, low confidence)
