hopihin = (t:v) (w:speaking to/greeting) (d:hopih, speak to or greet, with the linking ending in: speaking to someone, and then) (e:amah ~ ka zol kik ding hi) (b:hopih) (r:28.2.14/9.10.4) (q:draft)
hutna = (t:n) (w:protection/shelter/refuge/defence) (d:hut, protect or spare, with na; hutna-in is in order to protect or save) (e:nangma ~ sungah lungdamin la ka sa hi) (r:19.63.7/19.61.4) (q:draft)
