khebaite = (t:n) (w:the lame/lame people) (d:khebai, lame, with the plural te) (e:mipoite, ~ leh mittawte na sam in) (r:42.14.13/33.4.6) (q:draft)
khenuai = (t:n) (w:sole of the foot/sole) (d:khe, foot, and nuai, under: the underside of the foot; with ah, under the feet) (e:na ~ panun na luzang dong uhah) (r:5.28.35/19.47.3) (q:draft)
khuaneu = (t:n) (w:village/small town) (d:khua, town, and neu, small; set against khuapi, city) (e:khuapi leh ~ ah pai kawikawi a) (r:42.13.22/41.6.36) (q:draft)
