hopihsak = (t:v) (w:greet/give greetings to) (d:hopih with sak: greet someone on the speaker's behalf, as in the closing greetings of a letter) (e:ka it Amflias na ~ un) (b:hopih) (r:45.16.8/55.4.19) (q:draft)
