sawmsimna = (t:n) (w:conspiracy/plot/treason/intrigue) (d:secret plan made against someone) (e:Ama nasemte kipanin ~ khat vaihawm uh a) (b:sawmsim) (r:12.12.20/23.8.12) (q:draft)
sek = (t:n) (w:hammer) (d:tool for beating metal; sek tawi mihing, a man who holds a hammer, is a craftsman or smith) (e:Topa in ~ tawi mihing li hong lak hi) (r:38.1.20/2.37.7) (q:draft)
