sual = (t:n) (w:floor) (d:floor of a building; sual puan is a rug spread on the floor) (e:a ~ panin a innsun ciang dong) (r:11.7.7/26.41.16) (q:draft)
suangpeekte = (t:n) (w:stone tablets/tablets) (d:plural of suangpeek, flat slab of stone, used of the tablets of the law) (e:thute tua ~ tungah ka gelh ding a) (b:suangpeek) (r:5.10.2/5.9.11) (q:draft)
