cingh = (t:adj) (w:generous/openhanded) (d:giving freely to those in need) (e:A zawng mite tungah amah ~ a) (r:20.31.20/20.22.9) (q:draft)
dangtakin = (t:adv) (w:thirsty/in thirst) (d:dangtak, be thirsty, with the ending in; often paired with gilkial, hungry) (e:~ puk ding uh hi) (b:dangtak) (r:30.8.13/46.4.11) (q:draft)
