hatte = (t:n) (w:strong ones/the mighty/champions) (d:plural of hat; after a noun, strong ones of that kind, after a verb, those who are quick or good at doing it, as in a tai hatte the fast runners) (e:Bashan gam bawngtal ~ in kei hong umcih) (b:hat) (r:19.22.12/30.2.15) (q:draft)
