pulakin = (t:v) (w:confess/declare) (d:connective form of pulak, confessing or making known openly, followed by another verb) (e:amau mawhna khialhna ~ Jordan gun sungah) (b:pulak) (r:40.3.6/16.9.3) (q:draft)
sapi = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:beast/great beast) (d:sa animal with pi great, a large wild animal; in Daniel the beasts of the vision) (e:a kibang lo ~ gol li) (b:sa) (r:27.7.3/27.7.17) (q:draft)
